[*][b]Silent Ops — realistic stealth (this mod)[/b]: released: [url=https://github.com/hubertdungen/SpaceBourne2-SilentOps]GitHub[/url] · [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/spacebourne2/mods/6]Nexus Mods[/url]
