[*][b]Faction Power — your faction gains power from dungeons, sales and missions[/b]: released: [url=https://github.com/hubertdungen/SpaceBourne2-FactionPower]GitHub[/url] · [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/spacebourne2/mods/9]Nexus Mods[/url]
